# OLX India

> OLX India is one of India's leading online marketplaces for buying and selling of used-goods and services, committed to fostering sustainable practices through its core mission of reducing and reuse. Operating across 12 diverse categories, including cars, bikes, real estate, electronics, smartphones and more, the platform covers every aspect of daily life and attracts 30 Million unique visitors each month.

Our Core Values drive our commitment to building a reliable and user-friendly platform for buying and selling goods and services, ensuring we create value for our customers and stakeholders.

## Marketplace Categories
- [Cars](https://www.olx.in/cars_c84): Browse used cars, second-hand commercial vehicles, and check local seller listings across India.
- [Mobile Phones](https://www.olx.in/mobiles_c1411): Search used smartphones, tablets, and mobile accessories from top brands.
- [Bikes & Motorcycles](https://www.olx.in/bikes_c2198): Explore second-hand motorcycles, scooters, and bicycles.
- [Real Estate & Properties](https://www.olx.in/properties_c3): Find residential and commercial properties for sale or rent, including apartments and land.
- [Electronics & Appliances](https://www.olx.in/electronics-appliances_c99): Access pre-owned laptops, TVs, kitchen appliances, and home electronics.
- [Commercial Vehicles & Spares](https://www.olx.in/commercial-vehicles-spares_c2207): Browse used commercial trucks, auto-rickshaws, and spare automotive parts.
- [Jobs](https://www.olx.in/jobs_c4): Search local job openings, online data entry positions, and full-time/part-time employment listings.
- [Furniture](https://www.olx.in/furniture_c628): Find used home and office furniture, including sofas, beds, and dining tables.
- [Fashion](https://www.olx.in/fashion_c87): Explore second-hand and budget clothing, footwear, and personal accessories.
- [Pets](https://www.olx.in/pets_c103): View pet care, pet accessories, and pet adoption listings.
- [Books, Sports & Hobbies](https://www.olx.in/books-sports-hobbies_c767): Find used textbooks, gym equipment, musical instruments, and hobby items.
- [Services](https://www.olx.in/services_c619): Discover local services including electronics repair, drivers, and home maintenance.

## Sell & Post Listings
- [Post an Ad](https://www.olx.in/post): Main portal to create a new listing and advertise any product or service to buyers.
- [Sell Your Car](https://www.olx.in/sell/cars_c84): Dedicated pipeline to list a pre-owned car for sale with specific vehicle fields.
- [Sell Your Mobile](https://www.olx.in/sell/mobile-phones_c1453): Dedicated interface to list used mobile devices with brand and specification details.

